==Faroese==
{{fo-conj-vera}}

===Verb===
'''eri'''

# I [[am]], ''1st person singular present form of'' [[vera]] (to be)

====Usage notes====
*[[eg]] '''eri''' [[dani]] - I am Dane
*[[tað]] '''eri''' eg - that's me
*[[tí]] '''eri''' eg [[komin]] - that's why I came
*'''eg eri fyri''' - I am for something, in favour of something
**eg eri [[ikki]] fyri at [[fara]] [[í dag]] - I'm not in favour of going today
*'''eg eri væl / illa fyri''' - I'm fine / badly off

