==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|er}}

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: e·ri
*Rhymes: [[keriä|keri]], [[meri]], [[periä|peri]], [[veri]]
*{{IPA|/ˈeri/}}

===Adjective===
'''eri''' (''indeclinable; not comparable'')

# [[different]], ([[another|an]])[[other]]:
#:*[[se3Finnish|Se]] [[on#Finnish|on]] '''eri''' [[sana]].
#:**That's a ''different'' / an''other'' word.
# different, [[separate]].

====Inflection====
{{fi-decl-pron|1s=[[eri-]]|8p=[[erillään]]|10p=[[erilleen]]|12p=[[erikseen]]|a8p=[[erittäin]]}}
The cases of ''eri'' are used only as adverbs.

====Synonyms====
*(''separate'') [[erillinen]]

====Derived terms====
*[[olla#Finnish|olla]] ''eri'' [[mieli|mieltä]] [[joku|jonkun]] [[kanssa]] = to [[disagree]] with sb
*''eri'' [[tapa#Finnish|tavalla]] = in a [[different]] [[manner]], in a different [[way]]
*''eri'' [[tapa#Finnish|tavoin]] = in a [[different]] [[manner]], in a different [[way]]
*adjectives: [[erikoinen]], [[erilainen]], [[erillinen]], [[erinäinen]], [[erityinen]], [[eriävä]]
*verbs: [[eristää]], [[eritä]], [[eriyttää]]

===Adverb===
'''eri'''

# {{context|rare|lang=fi}} [[really]], [[truly]]:
#:*[[olla#Finnish|Olet]] '''eri''' [[hyvä]] [[kaveri]].
#:**You're a ''really'' good friend.

